CORE
quoted.sh
--shell-max-arguments 2
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
^\[shell-argument-count\.[0-9]+\] .*: FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
--
^warning: ignoring
^\[assertion\.[0-9]+\] .*: FAILURE$
^\[shell-unsupported\.[0-9]+\] .*: FAILURE$
--
Pathname expansion with expansions in the pattern: quoted ones, and
unquoted ones that yield one field, are matched literally.
